alue of md\nmd = gr + 67 = 357 + 67 = 424.\n\n## Step 6: Calculate the value of jx\njx = md - 77 = 424 - 77 = 347.\n\n## Step 7: Calculate the value of xw\nxw = jx - 85 = 347 - 85 = 262.\n\n## Step 8: Calculate the value of ij\nij = xw - 56 = 262 - 56 = 206.\n\n## Step 9: Calculate the value of xx\nxx = ij - 30 = 206 - 30 = 176.\n\n## Step 10: Calculate the value of bk\nbk = xx - 69 = 176 - 69 = 107.\n\n## Step 11: Calculate the value of wx\nwx = bk + 72 = 107 + 72 = 179.\n\n## Step 12: Calculate the value of gg\ngg = wx - 73 = 179 - 73 = 106.\n\n## Step 13: Calculate the value of qz\nqz = gg - 94 = 106 - 94 = 12.\n\n## Step 14: Calculate the value of zd\nzd = qz - 69 = 12 - 69 = -57.\n\n## Step 15: Calculate the value of pm\npm = zd - 82 = -57 - 82 = -139.\n\n## Step 16: Calculate the value of ub\nub = pm - 72 = -139 - 72 = -211.\n\n## Step 17: Calculate the value of oq\noq = ub + 51 = -211 + 51 = -160.\n\n## Step 18: Calculate the value of vl\nvl = oq + 88 = -160 + 88 = -72.\n\n## Step 19: Calculate the value of rn\nrn = vl - 71 = -72 - 71 = -143.\n\n## Step 20: Calculate the value of tu\ntu = rn - 48 = -143 - 48 = -191.\n\n## Step 21: Calculate the value of ko\nko = tu - 49 = -191 - 49 = -240.\n\n## Step 22: Calculate the value of bc\nbc = ko + 72 = -240 + 72 = -168.\n\n## Step 23: Calculate the value of oi\noi = bc - 97 = -168 - 97 = -265.\n\n## Step 24: Calculate the value of si\nsi = oi + 53 = -265 + 53 = -212.\n\n## Step 25: Calculate the value of mo\nmo = si + 34 = -212 + 34 = -178.\n\n## Step 26: Calculate the value of oz\noz = mo + 17 = -178 + 17 = -161.\n\n## Step 27: Calculate the value of qr\nqr = oz + 44 = -161 + 44 = -117.\n\n## Step 28: Calculate the value of us\nus = qr + 97 = -117 + 97 = -20.\n\n## Step 29: Calculate the value of gm\ngm = us + 76 = -20 + 76 = 56.\n\n## Step 30: Calculate the value of wb\nwb = gm + 44 = 56 + 44 = 100.\n\n## Step 31: Calculate the value of gz\ngz = wb + 36 = 100 + 36 = 136.\n\nThe final answer is: $\\boxed{136}$"}
