= od + 47 = 168 + 47 = 215.\n\n## Step 5: Calculate the value of uw\nuw = zr - 35 = 215 - 35 = 180.\n\n## Step 6: Calculate the value of bd\nbd = uw + 33 = 180 + 33 = 213.\n\n## Step 7: Calculate the value of si\nsi = bd + 59 = 213 + 59 = 272.\n\n## Step 8: Calculate the value of jv\njv = si - 12 = 272 - 12 = 260.\n\n## Step 9: Calculate the value of zo\nzo = jv - 63 = 260 - 63 = 197.\n\n## Step 10: Calculate the value of cb\ncb = zo + 28 = 197 + 28 = 225.\n\n## Step 11: Calculate the value of ge\nge = cb - 18 = 225 - 18 = 207.\n\n## Step 12: Calculate the value of el\nel = ge - 48 = 207 - 48 = 159.\n\n## Step 13: Calculate the value of oq\noq = el + 86 = 159 + 86 = 245.\n\n## Step 14: Calculate the value of sm\nsm = oq - 18 = 245 - 18 = 227.\n\n## Step 15: Calculate the value of js\njs = sm - 55 = 227 - 55 = 172.\n\n## Step 16: Calculate the value of oz\noz = js - 71 = 172 - 71 = 101.\n\n## Step 17: Calculate the value of vk\nvk = oz - 33 = 101 - 33 = 68.\n\n## Step 18: Calculate the value of ea\nea = vk - 70 = 68 - 70 = -2.\n\n## Step 19: Calculate the value of wp\nwp = ea + 17 = -2 + 17 = 15.\n\n## Step 20: Calculate the value of an\nan = wp - 12 = 15 - 12 = 3.\n\n## Step 21: Calculate the value of in\nin = an - 61 = 3 - 61 = -58.\n\n## Step 22: Calculate the value of qb\nqb = in + 80 = -58 + 80 = 22.\n\n## Step 23: Calculate the value of la\nla = qb - 56 = 22 - 56 = -34.\n\n## Step 24: Calculate the value of he\nhe = la - 84 = -34 - 84 = -118.\n\n## Step 25: Calculate the value of pi\npi = he + 67 = -118 + 67 = -51.\n\n## Step 26: Calculate the value of gh\ngh = pi + 33 = -51 + 33 = -18.\n\n## Step 27: Calculate the value of cv\ncv = gh + 25 = -18 + 25 = 7.\n\n## Step 28: Calculate the value of fm\nfm = cv + 69 = 7 + 69 = 76.\n\n## Step 29: Calculate the value of yi\nyi = fm - 75 = 76 - 75 = 1.\n\n## Step 30: Calculate the value of rn\nrn = yi - 77 = 1 - 77 = -76.\n\n## Step 31: Calculate the value of ez\nez = rn - 69 = -76 - 69 = -145.\n\n## Step 32: Calculate the value of ff\nff = ez + 85 = -145 + 85 = -60.\n\nThe final answer is: $\\boxed{-60}$"}
