e bx\nbx = zq + 83 = 184 + 83 = 267\n\n## Step 6: Calculate cw\ncw = bx - 81 = 267 - 81 = 186\n\n## Step 7: Calculate vc\nvc = cw + 23 = 186 + 23 = 209\n\n## Step 8: Calculate ds\nds = vc + 57 = 209 + 57 = 266\n\n## Step 9: Calculate ok\nok = ds + 80 = 266 + 80 = 346\n\n## Step 10: Calculate wy\nwy = ok + 82 = 346 + 82 = 428\n\n## Step 11: Calculate ch\nch = wy + 89 = 428 + 89 = 517\n\n## Step 12: Calculate tz\ntz = ch + 73 = 517 + 73 = 590\n\n## Step 13: Calculate il\nil = tz - 50 = 590 - 50 = 540\n\n## Step 14: Calculate bm\nbm = il - 84 = 540 - 84 = 456\n\n## Step 15: Calculate dk\ndk = bm - 56 = 456 - 56 = 400\n\n## Step 16: Calculate rc\nrc = dk - 41 = 400 - 41 = 359\n\n## Step 17: Calculate qm\nqm = rc + 99 = 359 + 99 = 458\n\n## Step 18: Calculate ct\nct = qm + 20 = 458 + 20 = 478\n\n## Step 19: Calculate jm\njm = ct - 77 = 478 - 77 = 401\n\n## Step 20: Calculate do\ndo = jm - 53 = 401 - 53 = 348\n\n## Step 21: Calculate vs\nvs = do - 46 = 348 - 46 = 302\n\n## Step 22: Calculate qs\nqs = vs + 25 = 302 + 25 = 327\n\n## Step 23: Calculate ci\nci = qs - 31 = 327 - 31 = 296\n\n## Step 24: Calculate wh\nwh = ci - 29 = 296 - 29 = 267\n\n## Step 25: Calculate ew\new = wh - 63 = 267 - 63 = 204\n\n## Step 26: Calculate iu\niu = ew + 95 = 204 + 95 = 299\n\n## Step 27: Calculate yv\nyv = iu + 81 = 299 + 81 = 380\n\n## Step 28: Calculate ys\nys = yv - 53 = 380 - 53 = 327\n\n## Step 29: Calculate cl\ncl = ys - 86 = 327 - 86 = 241\n\n## Step 30: Calculate ws\nws = cl - 84 = 241 - 84 = 157\n\n## Step 31: Calculate xb\nxb = ws - 18 = 157 - 18 = 139\n\n## Step 32: Calculate pq\npq = xb + 44 = 139 + 44 = 183\n\nThe final answer is: $\\boxed{183}$"}
