 610.\n\n## Step 5: Calculate iy\niy = qk - 64 = 610 - 64 = 546.\n\n## Step 6: Calculate rp\nrp = iy + 82 = 546 + 82 = 628.\n\n## Step 7: Calculate af\naf = rp - 84 = 628 - 84 = 544.\n\n## Step 8: Calculate qd\nqd = af + 46 = 544 + 46 = 590.\n\n## Step 9: Calculate zx\nzx = qd + 10 = 590 + 10 = 600.\n\n## Step 10: Calculate kf\nkf = zx - 40 = 600 - 40 = 560.\n\n## Step 11: Calculate jj\njj = kf - 29 = 560 - 29 = 531.\n\n## Step 12: Calculate za\nza = jj - 48 = 531 - 48 = 483.\n\n## Step 13: Calculate it\nit = za - 68 = 483 - 68 = 415.\n\n## Step 14: Calculate ak\nak = it - 18 = 415 - 18 = 397.\n\n## Step 15: Calculate lr\nlr = ak + 99 = 397 + 99 = 496.\n\n## Step 16: Calculate lx\nlx = lr - 11 = 496 - 11 = 485.\n\n## Step 17: Calculate nf\nnf = lx - 72 = 485 - 72 = 413.\n\n## Step 18: Calculate fp\nfp = nf + 70 = 413 + 70 = 483.\n\n## Step 19: Calculate xs\nxs = fp + 68 = 483 + 68 = 551.\n\n## Step 20: Calculate mf\nmf = xs + 73 = 551 + 73 = 624.\n\n## Step 21: Calculate aw\naw = mf + 28 = 624 + 28 = 652.\n\n## Step 22: Calculate ir\nir = aw + 61 = 652 + 61 = 713.\n\n## Step 23: Calculate xt\nxt = ir - 14 = 713 - 14 = 699.\n\n## Step 24: Calculate jz\njz = xt + 94 = 699 + 94 = 793.\n\n## Step 25: Calculate au\nau = jz - 87 = 793 - 87 = 706.\n\n## Step 26: Calculate gb\ngb = au - 71 = 706 - 71 = 635.\n\n## Step 27: Calculate xw\nxw = gb + 39 = 635 + 39 = 674.\n\n## Step 28: Calculate yw\nyw = xw - 22 = 674 - 22 = 652.\n\n## Step 29: Calculate bc\nbc = yw + 79 = 652 + 79 = 731.\n\n## Step 30: Calculate sh\nsh = bc + 41 = 731 + 41 = 772.\n\n## Step 31: Calculate rz\nrz = sh + 60 = 772 + 60 = 832.\n\nThe final answer is: $\\boxed{832}$"}
