te ky\nky = vh + 55 = 259 + 55 = 314.\n\n## Step 8: Calculate ei\nei = ky + 71 = 314 + 71 = 385.\n\n## Step 9: Calculate bb\nbb = ei - 84 = 385 - 84 = 301.\n\n## Step 10: Calculate ju\nju = bb + 61 = 301 + 61 = 362.\n\n## Step 11: Calculate pd\npd = ju + 24 = 362 + 24 = 386.\n\n## Step 12: Calculate qn\nqn = pd + 41 = 386 + 41 = 427.\n\n## Step 13: Calculate jy\njy = qn - 17 = 427 - 17 = 410.\n\n## Step 14: Calculate tt\ntt = jy - 18 = 410 - 18 = 392.\n\n## Step 15: Calculate mn\nmn = tt - 34 = 392 - 34 = 358.\n\n## Step 16: Calculate zf\nzf = mn + 42 = 358 + 42 = 400.\n\n## Step 17: Calculate pv\npv = zf - 54 = 400 - 54 = 346.\n\n## Step 18: Calculate fk\nfk = pv - 31 = 346 - 31 = 315.\n\n## Step 19: Calculate vs\nvs = fk - 22 = 315 - 22 = 293.\n\n## Step 20: Calculate cl\ncl = vs - 52 = 293 - 52 = 241.\n\n## Step 21: Calculate fn\nfn = cl + 16 = 241 + 16 = 257.\n\n## Step 22: Calculate ht\nht = fn - 12 = 257 - 12 = 245.\n\n## Step 23: Calculate fy\nfy = ht - 44 = 245 - 44 = 201.\n\n## Step 24: Calculate uz\nuz = fy - 91 = 201 - 91 = 110.\n\n## Step 25: Calculate wa\nwa = uz + 35 = 110 + 35 = 145.\n\n## Step 26: Calculate ih\nih = wa - 43 = 145 - 43 = 102.\n\n## Step 27: Calculate na\nna = ih + 72 = 102 + 72 = 174.\n\n## Step 28: Calculate vg\nvg = na + 89 = 174 + 89 = 263.\n\n## Step 29: Calculate ew\new = vg + 61 = 263 + 61 = 324.\n\n## Step 30: Calculate ze\nze = ew - 85 = 324 - 85 = 239.\n\n## Step 31: Calculate cs\ncs = ze - 33 = 239 - 33 = 206.\n\nThe final answer is: $\\boxed{206}$"}
