 44\njl = 249 - 44 = 205\n\n## Step 5: Evaluate the fifth expression: hu = jl - 80\nhu = 205 - 80 = 125\n\n## Step 6: Evaluate the sixth expression: th = hu + 46\nth = 125 + 46 = 171\n\n## Step 7: Evaluate the seventh expression: yt = th - 82\nyt = 171 - 82 = 89\n\n## Step 8: Evaluate the eighth expression: tl = yt + 73\ntl = 89 + 73 = 162\n\n## Step 9: Evaluate the ninth expression: hf = tl + 34\nhf = 162 + 34 = 196\n\n## Step 10: Evaluate the tenth expression: sx = hf + 92\nsx = 196 + 92 = 288\n\n## Step 11: Evaluate the eleventh expression: lq = sx - 26\nlq = 288 - 26 = 262\n\n## Step 12: Evaluate the twelfth expression: sb = lq - 75\nsb = 262 - 75 = 187\n\n## Step 13: Evaluate the thirteenth expression: kk = sb - 83\nkk = 187 - 83 = 104\n\n## Step 14: Evaluate the fourteenth expression: hs = kk + 35\nhs = 104 + 35 = 139\n\n## Step 15: Evaluate the fifteenth expression: jz = hs - 78\njz = 139 - 78 = 61\n\n## Step 16: Evaluate the sixteenth expression: eq = jz - 94\neq = 61 - 94 = -33\n\n## Step 17: Evaluate the seventeenth expression: mu = eq - 21\nmu = -33 - 21 = -54\n\n## Step 18: Evaluate the eighteenth expression: uo = mu - 28\nuo = -54 - 28 = -82\n\n## Step 19: Evaluate the nineteenth expression: gw = uo - 29\ngw = -82 - 29 = -111\n\n## Step 20: Evaluate the twentieth expression: jg = gw - 20\njg = -111 - 20 = -131\n\n## Step 21: Evaluate the twenty-first expression: gr = jg + 92\ngr = -131 + 92 = -39\n\n## Step 22: Evaluate the twenty-second expression: jj = gr + 79\njj = -39 + 79 = 40\n\n## Step 23: Evaluate the twenty-third expression: hx = jj - 36\nhx = 40 - 36 = 4\n\n## Step 24: Evaluate the twenty-fourth expression: ok = hx - 84\nok = 4 - 84 = -80\n\n## Step 25: Evaluate the twenty-fifth expression: wr = ok + 27\nwr = -80 + 27 = -53\n\n## Step 26: Evaluate the twenty-sixth expression: tz = wr + 71\ntz = -53 + 71 = 18\n\n## Step 27: Evaluate the twenty-seventh expression: hy = tz - 61\nhy = 18 - 61 = -43\n\n## Step 28: Evaluate the twenty-eighth expression: in = hy + 59\nin = -43 + 59 = 16\n\n## Step 29: Evaluate the twenty-ninth expression: lu = in - 26\nlu = 16 - 26 = -10\n\n## Step 30: Evaluate the thirtieth expression: kl = lu - 60\nkl = -10 - 60 = -70\n\n## Step 31: Evaluate the thirty-first expression: ag = kl - 28\nag = -70 - 28 = -98\n\nThe final answer is: $\\boxed{-98}$"}
