n\n## Step 4: Calculate ud.\nud = et - 94 = 486 - 94 = 392.\n\n## Step 5: Calculate hw.\nhw = ud - 83 = 392 - 83 = 309.\n\n## Step 6: Calculate pm.\npm = hw + 91 = 309 + 91 = 400.\n\n## Step 7: Calculate nr.\nnr = pm - 39 = 400 - 39 = 361.\n\n## Step 8: Calculate uv.\nuv = nr + 36 = 361 + 36 = 397.\n\n## Step 9: Calculate lk.\nlk = uv - 34 = 397 - 34 = 363.\n\n## Step 10: Calculate xa.\nxa = lk + 27 = 363 + 27 = 390.\n\n## Step 11: Calculate fv.\nfv = xa - 23 = 390 - 23 = 367.\n\n## Step 12: Calculate xl.\nxl = fv - 10 = 367 - 10 = 357.\n\n## Step 13: Calculate kh.\nkh = xl - 71 = 357 - 71 = 286.\n\n## Step 14: Calculate eg.\neg = kh + 76 = 286 + 76 = 362.\n\n## Step 15: Calculate kg.\nkg = eg - 74 = 362 - 74 = 288.\n\n## Step 16: Calculate qf.\nqf = kg - 57 = 288 - 57 = 231.\n\n## Step 17: Calculate mx.\nmx = qf - 79 = 231 - 79 = 152.\n\n## Step 18: Calculate ko.\nko = mx + 10 = 152 + 10 = 162.\n\n## Step 19: Calculate mv.\nmv = ko + 21 = 162 + 21 = 183.\n\n## Step 20: Calculate mg.\nmg = mv + 69 = 183 + 69 = 252.\n\n## Step 21: Calculate ax.\nax = mg - 67 = 252 - 67 = 185.\n\n## Step 22: Calculate wk.\nwk = ax + 96 = 185 + 96 = 281.\n\n## Step 23: Calculate yi.\nyi = wk - 26 = 281 - 26 = 255.\n\n## Step 24: Calculate hy.\nhy = yi - 46 = 255 - 46 = 209.\n\n## Step 25: Calculate cu.\ncu = hy - 61 = 209 - 61 = 148.\n\n## Step 26: Calculate hz.\nhz = cu - 31 = 148 - 31 = 117.\n\n## Step 27: Calculate em.\nem = hz - 66 = 117 - 66 = 51.\n\n## Step 28: Calculate vj.\nvj = em - 49 = 51 - 49 = 2.\n\n## Step 29: Calculate ry.\nry = vj + 19 = 2 + 19 = 21.\n\n## Step 30: Calculate ph.\nph = ry + 49 = 21 + 49 = 70.\n\n## Step 31: Calculate cx.\ncx = ph - 22 = 70 - 22 = 48.\n\n## Step 32: Calculate dw.\ndw = cx - 18 = 48 - 18 = 30.\n\nThe final answer is: $\\boxed{30}$"}
