he expression for wo\nwo = mx - 30 = 44 - 30 = 14.\n\n## Step 6: Evaluate the expression for gr\ngr = wo + 12 = 14 + 12 = 26.\n\n## Step 7: Evaluate the expression for bb\nbb = gr - 39 = 26 - 39 = -13.\n\n## Step 8: Evaluate the expression for qf\nqf = bb + 83 = -13 + 83 = 70.\n\n## Step 9: Evaluate the expression for qa\nqa = qf + 17 = 70 + 17 = 87.\n\n## Step 10: Evaluate the expression for cy\ncy = qa + 92 = 87 + 92 = 179.\n\n## Step 11: Evaluate the expression for eb\neb = cy - 45 = 179 - 45 = 134.\n\n## Step 12: Evaluate the expression for ey\ney = eb + 98 = 134 + 98 = 232.\n\n## Step 13: Evaluate the expression for mo\nmo = ey - 86 = 232 - 86 = 146.\n\n## Step 14: Evaluate the expression for sr\nsr = mo - 29 = 146 - 29 = 117.\n\n## Step 15: Evaluate the expression for ww\nww = sr - 81 = 117 - 81 = 36.\n\n## Step 16: Evaluate the expression for rs\nrs = ww - 30 = 36 - 30 = 6.\n\n## Step 17: Evaluate the expression for if\nif = rs + 61 = 6 + 61 = 67.\n\n## Step 18: Evaluate the expression for hw\nhw = if + 98 = 67 + 98 = 165.\n\n## Step 19: Evaluate the expression for mm\nmm = hw + 84 = 165 + 84 = 249.\n\n## Step 20: Evaluate the expression for yq\nyq = mm - 54 = 249 - 54 = 195.\n\n## Step 21: Evaluate the expression for nf\nnf = yq + 24 = 195 + 24 = 219.\n\n## Step 22: Evaluate the expression for my\nmy = nf + 76 = 219 + 76 = 295.\n\n## Step 23: Evaluate the expression for qv\nqv = my + 65 = 295 + 65 = 360.\n\n## Step 24: Evaluate the expression for dq\ndq = qv + 32 = 360 + 32 = 392.\n\n## Step 25: Evaluate the expression for ys\nys = dq + 24 = 392 + 24 = 416.\n\n## Step 26: Evaluate the expression for uk\nuk = ys - 10 = 416 - 10 = 406.\n\n## Step 27: Evaluate the expression for tj\ntj = uk - 96 = 406 - 96 = 310.\n\n## Step 28: Evaluate the expression for py\npy = tj - 68 = 310 - 68 = 242.\n\n## Step 29: Evaluate the expression for df\ndf = py + 95 = 242 + 95 = 337.\n\n## Step 30: Evaluate the expression for id\nid = df + 25 = 337 + 25 = 362.\n\n## Step 31: Evaluate the expression for jo\njo = id - 81 = 362 - 81 = 281.\n\nThe final answer is: $\\boxed{281}$"}
