\n## Step 4: Calculate ht\nht = lg + 22 = 436 + 22 = 458.\n\n## Step 5: Calculate cx\ncx = ht - 48 = 458 - 48 = 410.\n\n## Step 6: Calculate co\nco = cx + 97 = 410 + 97 = 507.\n\n## Step 7: Calculate ka\nka = co + 31 = 507 + 31 = 538.\n\n## Step 8: Calculate vg\nvg = ka - 29 = 538 - 29 = 509.\n\n## Step 9: Calculate nd\nnd = vg - 79 = 509 - 79 = 430.\n\n## Step 10: Calculate jy\njy = nd + 32 = 430 + 32 = 462.\n\n## Step 11: Calculate or\nor = jy + 67 = 462 + 67 = 529.\n\n## Step 12: Calculate pw\npw = or + 54 = 529 + 54 = 583.\n\n## Step 13: Calculate hf\nhf = pw - 18 = 583 - 18 = 565.\n\n## Step 14: Calculate jt\njt = hf - 66 = 565 - 66 = 499.\n\n## Step 15: Calculate jl\njl = jt - 55 = 499 - 55 = 444.\n\n## Step 16: Calculate ti\nti = jl + 56 = 444 + 56 = 500.\n\n## Step 17: Calculate cv\ncv = ti + 43 = 500 + 43 = 543.\n\n## Step 18: Calculate zc\nzc = cv + 71 = 543 + 71 = 614.\n\n## Step 19: Calculate wo\nwo = zc - 76 = 614 - 76 = 538.\n\n## Step 20: Calculate zt\nzt = wo + 76 = 538 + 76 = 614.\n\n## Step 21: Calculate dc\ndc = zt + 31 = 614 + 31 = 645.\n\n## Step 22: Calculate yb\nyb = dc + 72 = 645 + 72 = 717.\n\n## Step 23: Calculate qt\nqt = yb + 52 = 717 + 52 = 769.\n\n## Step 24: Calculate ql\nql = qt - 17 = 769 - 17 = 752.\n\n## Step 25: Calculate cb\ncb = ql - 53 = 752 - 53 = 699.\n\n## Step 26: Calculate zx\nzx = cb + 48 = 699 + 48 = 747.\n\n## Step 27: Calculate ri\nri = zx - 81 = 747 - 81 = 666.\n\n## Step 28: Calculate nu\nnu = ri + 48 = 666 + 48 = 714.\n\n## Step 29: Calculate am\nam = nu - 69 = 714 - 69 = 645.\n\n## Step 30: Calculate zi\nzi = am - 75 = 645 - 75 = 570.\n\n## Step 31: Calculate sv\nsv = zi + 84 = 570 + 84 = 654.\n\nThe final answer is: $\\boxed{654}$"}
