n\n## Step 4: Calculate xn using vm.\nxn = vm - 91 = 323 - 91 = 232.\n\n## Step 5: Calculate ha using xn.\nha = xn - 20 = 232 - 20 = 212.\n\n## Step 6: Calculate ix using ha.\nix = ha - 25 = 212 - 25 = 187.\n\n## Step 7: Calculate ff using ix.\nff = ix - 31 = 187 - 31 = 156.\n\n## Step 8: Calculate zd using ff.\nzd = ff + 57 = 156 + 57 = 213.\n\n## Step 9: Calculate sh using zd.\nsh = zd + 14 = 213 + 14 = 227.\n\n## Step 10: Calculate ql using sh.\nql = sh - 72 = 227 - 72 = 155.\n\n## Step 11: Calculate ih using ql.\nih = ql - 30 = 155 - 30 = 125.\n\n## Step 12: Calculate ik using ih.\nik = ih - 42 = 125 - 42 = 83.\n\n## Step 13: Calculate fr using ik.\nfr = ik - 74 = 83 - 74 = 9.\n\n## Step 14: Calculate pl using fr.\npl = fr + 39 = 9 + 39 = 48.\n\n## Step 15: Calculate gk using pl.\ngk = pl + 49 = 48 + 49 = 97.\n\n## Step 16: Calculate fe using gk.\nfe = gk + 98 = 97 + 98 = 195.\n\n## Step 17: Calculate xw using fe.\nxw = fe - 13 = 195 - 13 = 182.\n\n## Step 18: Calculate hk using xw.\nhk = xw + 35 = 182 + 35 = 217.\n\n## Step 19: Calculate hy using hk.\nhy = hk + 51 = 217 + 51 = 268.\n\n## Step 20: Calculate bc using hy.\nbc = hy - 96 = 268 - 96 = 172.\n\n## Step 21: Calculate qa using bc.\nqa = bc - 23 = 172 - 23 = 149.\n\n## Step 22: Calculate jl using qa.\njl = qa - 29 = 149 - 29 = 120.\n\n## Step 23: Calculate ct using jl.\nct = jl - 76 = 120 - 76 = 44.\n\n## Step 24: Calculate dt using ct.\ndt = ct + 79 = 44 + 79 = 123.\n\n## Step 25: Calculate qo using dt.\nqo = dt - 82 = 123 - 82 = 41.\n\n## Step 26: Calculate mk using qo.\nmk = qo - 30 = 41 - 30 = 11.\n\n## Step 27: Calculate fc using mk.\nfc = mk - 41 = 11 - 41 = -30.\n\n## Step 28: Calculate gy using fc.\ngy = fc - 47 = -30 - 47 = -77.\n\n## Step 29: Calculate ty using gy.\nty = gy - 39 = -77 - 39 = -116.\n\n## Step 30: Calculate um using ty.\num = ty + 14 = -116 + 14 = -102.\n\n## Step 31: Calculate kr using um.\nkr = um + 65 = -102 + 65 = -37.\n\n## Step 32: Calculate yd using kr.\nyd = kr - 97 = -37 - 97 = -134.\n\nThe final answer is: $\\boxed{-134}$"}
