46\nfj = 797\n\n## Step 40: Calculate uc\nuc = fj - 72\nuc = 797 - 72\nuc = 725\n\n## Step 41: Calculate oe\noe = uc + 49\noe = 725 + 49\noe = 774\n\n## Step 42: Calculate ug\nug = oe - 80\nug = 774 - 80\nug = 694\n\n## Step 43: Calculate he\nhe = ug + 43\nhe = 694 + 43\nhe = 737\n\n## Step 44: Calculate ro\nro = he - 89\nro = 737 - 89\nro = 648\n\n## Step 45: Calculate qi\nqi = ro + 70\nqi = 648 + 70\nqi = 718\n\n## Step 46: Calculate ur\nur = qi + 21\nur = 718 + 21\nur = 739\n\n## Step 47: Calculate xj\nxj = ur - 23\nxj = 739 - 23\nxj = 716\n\n## Step 48: Calculate ny\nny = xj + 67\nny = 716 + 67\nny = 783\n\nThe final answer is: $\\boxed{783}$"}
