tep 10: Calculate pv\npv = au - 76 = 808 - 76 = 732\n\n## Step 11: Calculate vq\nvq = pv - 99 = 732 - 99 = 633\n\n## Step 12: Calculate lk\nlk = vq - 28 = 633 - 28 = 605\n\n## Step 13: Calculate ci\nci = lk + 18 = 605 + 18 = 623\n\n## Step 14: Calculate it\nit = ci - 35 = 623 - 35 = 588\n\n## Step 15: Calculate um\num = it - 45 = 588 - 45 = 543\n\n## Step 16: Calculate vd\nvd = um + 55 = 543 + 55 = 598\n\n## Step 17: Calculate oe\noe = vd - 85 = 598 - 85 = 513\n\n## Step 18: Calculate kx\nkx = oe - 91 = 513 - 91 = 422\n\n## Step 19: Calculate gu\ngu = kx + 51 = 422 + 51 = 473\n\n## Step 20: Calculate ee\nee = gu + 17 = 473 + 17 = 490\n\n## Step 21: Calculate ki\nki = ee + 45 = 490 + 45 = 535\n\n## Step 22: Calculate il\nil = ki + 25 = 535 + 25 = 560\n\n## Step 23: Calculate ba\nba = il - 32 = 560 - 32 = 528\n\n## Step 24: Calculate zg\nzg = ba - 68 = 528 - 68 = 460\n\n## Step 25: Calculate kg\nkg = zg + 15 = 460 + 15 = 475\n\n## Step 26: Calculate ks\nks = kg - 99 = 475 - 99 = 376\n\n## Step 27: Calculate hq\nhq = ks + 46 = 376 + 46 = 422\n\n## Step 28: Calculate gm\ngm = hq - 12 = 422 - 12 = 410\n\n## Step 29: Calculate mf\nmf = gm - 46 = 410 - 46 = 364\n\n## Step 30: Calculate ys\nys = mf - 29 = 364 - 29 = 335\n\n## Step 31: Calculate or\nor = ys - 89 = 335 - 89 = 246\n\n## Step 32: Calculate dk\ndk = or + 47 = 246 + 47 = 293\n\n## Step 33: Calculate xw\nxw = dk + 66 = 293 + 66 = 359\n\n## Step 34: Calculate nh\nnh = xw - 27 = 359 - 27 = 332\n\n## Step 35: Calculate ph\nph = nh - 58 = 332 - 58 = 274\n\n## Step 36: Calculate ty\nty = ph + 52 = 274 + 52 = 326\n\n## Step 37: Calculate ju\nju = ty + 56 = 326 + 56 = 382\n\n## Step 38: Calculate ha\nha = ju + 68 = 382 + 68 = 450\n\n## Step 39: Calculate jt\njt = ha + 56 = 450 + 56 = 506\n\n## Step 40: Calculate sq\nsq = jt - 47 = 506 - 47 = 459\n\n## Step 41: Calculate la\nla = sq + 66 = 459 + 66 = 525\n\n## Step 42: Calculate dn\ndn = la + 64 = 525 + 64 = 589\n\n## Step 43: Calculate vo\nvo = dn + 24 = 589 + 24 = 613\n\n## Step 44: Calculate lv\nlv = vo + 17 = 613 + 17 = 630\n\n## Step 45: Calculate ah\nah = lv + 31 = 630 + 31 = 661\n\n## Step 46: Calculate lm\nlm = ah + 87 = 661 + 87 = 748\n\n## Step 47: Calculate wo\nwo = lm + 79 = 748 + 79 = 827\n\n## Step 48: Calculate mh\nmh = wo - 84 = 827 - 84 = 743\n\nThe final answer is: $\\boxed{743}$"}
