ep 8: Calculate jv\njv = si - 55 = 514 - 55 = 459\n\n## Step 9: Calculate zo\nzo = jv - 71 = 459 - 71 = 388\n\n## Step 10: Calculate cb\ncb = zo - 33 = 388 - 33 = 355\n\n## Step 11: Calculate ge\nge = cb - 70 = 355 - 70 = 285\n\n## Step 12: Calculate el\nel = ge + 17 = 285 + 17 = 302\n\n## Step 13: Calculate oq\noq = el - 12 = 302 - 12 = 290\n\n## Step 14: Calculate sm\nsm = oq - 61 = 290 - 61 = 229\n\n## Step 15: Calculate js\njs = sm + 80 = 229 + 80 = 309\n\n## Step 16: Calculate oz\noz = js - 56 = 309 - 56 = 253\n\n## Step 17: Calculate vk\nvk = oz - 84 = 253 - 84 = 169\n\n## Step 18: Calculate ea\nea = vk + 67 = 169 + 67 = 236\n\n## Step 19: Calculate wp\nwp = ea + 33 = 236 + 33 = 269\n\n## Step 20: Calculate an\nan = wp + 25 = 269 + 25 = 294\n\n## Step 21: Calculate in\nin = an + 69 = 294 + 69 = 363\n\n## Step 22: Calculate qb\nqb = in - 75 = 363 - 75 = 288\n\n## Step 23: Calculate la\nla = qb - 77 = 288 - 77 = 211\n\n## Step 24: Calculate he\nhe = la - 69 = 211 - 69 = 142\n\n## Step 25: Calculate pi\npi = he + 85 = 142 + 85 = 227\n\n## Step 26: Calculate gh\ngh = pi - 47 = 227 - 47 = 180\n\n## Step 27: Calculate cv\ncv = gh + 65 = 180 + 65 = 245\n\n## Step 28: Calculate fm\nfm = cv + 36 = 245 + 36 = 281\n\n## Step 29: Calculate yi\nyi = fm - 75 = 281 - 75 = 206\n\n## Step 30: Calculate rn\nrn = yi - 28 = 206 - 28 = 178\n\n## Step 31: Calculate ez\nez = rn - 45 = 178 - 45 = 133\n\n## Step 32: Calculate ff\nff = ez + 49 = 133 + 49 = 182\n\n## Step 33: Calculate ab\nab = ff - 49 = 182 - 49 = 133\n\n## Step 34: Calculate af\naf = ab + 20 = 133 + 20 = 153\n\n## Step 35: Calculate ig\nig = af + 98 = 153 + 98 = 251\n\n## Step 36: Calculate im\nim = ig - 71 = 251 - 71 = 180\n\n## Step 37: Calculate gn\ngn = im + 16 = 180 + 16 = 196\n\n## Step 38: Calculate go\ngo = gn + 86 = 196 + 86 = 282\n\n## Step 39: Calculate lk\nlk = go - 14 = 282 - 14 = 268\n\n## Step 40: Calculate mj\nmj = lk + 86 = 268 + 86 = 354\n\n## Step 41: Calculate hv\nhv = mj - 42 = 354 - 42 = 312\n\n## Step 42: Calculate vg\nvg = hv - 93 = 312 - 93 = 219\n\n## Step 43: Calculate yq\nyq = vg - 28 = 219 - 28 = 191\n\n## Step 44: Calculate ib\nib = yq + 91 = 191 + 91 = 282\n\n## Step 45: Calculate ht\nht = ib + 73 = 282 + 73 = 355\n\n## Step 46: Calculate pc\npc = ht - 36 = 355 - 36 = 319\n\n## Step 47: Calculate lt\nlt = pc + 82 = 319 + 82 = 401\n\n## Step 48: Calculate aw\naw = lt + 90 = 401 + 90 = 491\n\nThe final answer is: $\\boxed{491}$"}
