 Calculate the value of os\nos = sn + 86 = 590 + 86 = 676.\n\n## Step 10: Calculate the value of mp\nmp = os + 99 = 676 + 99 = 775.\n\n## Step 11: Calculate the value of aw\naw = mp + 34 = 775 + 34 = 809.\n\n## Step 12: Calculate the value of kt\nkt = aw + 12 = 809 + 12 = 821.\n\n## Step 13: Calculate the value of tg\ntg = kt - 81 = 821 - 81 = 740.\n\n## Step 14: Calculate the value of hu\nhu = tg - 57 = 740 - 57 = 683.\n\n## Step 15: Calculate the value of qh\nqh = hu - 77 = 683 - 77 = 606.\n\n## Step 16: Calculate the value of vf\nvf = qh - 47 = 606 - 47 = 559.\n\n## Step 17: Calculate the value of vg\nvg = vf + 96 = 559 + 96 = 655.\n\n## Step 18: Calculate the value of ds\nds = vg - 16 = 655 - 16 = 639.\n\n## Step 19: Calculate the value of hp\nhp = ds + 64 = 639 + 64 = 703.\n\n## Step 20: Calculate the value of we\nwe = hp - 22 = 703 - 22 = 681.\n\n## Step 21: Calculate the value of vu\nvu = we - 41 = 681 - 41 = 640.\n\n## Step 22: Calculate the value of kl\nkl = vu + 87 = 640 + 87 = 727.\n\n## Step 23: Calculate the value of ya\nya = kl - 67 = 727 - 67 = 660.\n\n## Step 24: Calculate the value of dm\ndm = ya - 19 = 660 - 19 = 641.\n\n## Step 25: Calculate the value of qs\nqs = dm - 70 = 641 - 70 = 571.\n\n## Step 26: Calculate the value of nf\nnf = qs - 62 = 571 - 62 = 509.\n\n## Step 27: Calculate the value of dr\ndr = nf + 34 = 509 + 34 = 543.\n\n## Step 28: Calculate the value of og\nog = dr - 67 = 543 - 67 = 476.\n\n## Step 29: Calculate the value of qd\nqd = og - 32 = 476 - 32 = 444.\n\n## Step 30: Calculate the value of jw\njw = qd + 12 = 444 + 12 = 456.\n\n## Step 31: Calculate the value of rn\nrn = jw + 42 = 456 + 42 = 498.\n\n## Step 32: Calculate the value of ht\nht = rn - 34 = 498 - 34 = 464.\n\n## Step 33: Calculate the value of za\nza = ht - 74 = 464 - 74 = 390.\n\n## Step 34: Calculate the value of lm\nlm = za - 52 = 390 - 52 = 338.\n\n## Step 35: Calculate the value of dv\ndv = lm - 62 = 338 - 62 = 276.\n\n## Step 36: Calculate the value of bu\nbu = dv - 88 = 276 - 88 = 188.\n\n## Step 37: Calculate the value of xe\nxe = bu - 44 = 188 - 44 = 144.\n\n## Step 38: Calculate the value of hx\nhx = xe - 94 = 144 - 94 = 50.\n\n## Step 39: Calculate the value of zv\nzv = hx - 72 = 50 - 72 = -22.\n\n## Step 40: Calculate the value of of\nof = zv + 58 = -22 + 58 = 36.\n\n## Step 41: Calculate the value of te\nte = of - 49 = 36 - 49 = -13.\n\n## Step 42: Calculate the value of hq\nhq = te - 51 = -13 - 51 = -64.\n\n## Step 43: Calculate the value of uh\nuh = hq - 94 = -64 - 94 = -158.\n\n## Step 44: Calculate the value of wr\nwr = uh + 89 = -158 + 89 = -69.\n\n## Step 45: Calculate the value of zk\nzk = wr - 98 = -69 - 98 = -167.\n\n## Step 46: Calculate the value of tv\ntv = zk - 50 = -167 - 50 = -217.\n\n## Step 47: Calculate the value of bd\nbd = tv - 72 = -217 - 72 = -289.\n\nThe final answer is: $\\boxed{-289}$"}
