ep 8: Calculate fk\nfk = dj - 64 = 1063 - 64 = 999.\n\n## Step 9: Calculate jt\njt = fk + 30 = 999 + 30 = 1029.\n\n## Step 10: Calculate ty\nty = jt + 78 = 1029 + 78 = 1107.\n\n## Step 11: Calculate ig\nig = ty - 99 = 1107 - 99 = 1008.\n\n## Step 12: Calculate pu\npu = ig - 92 = 1008 - 92 = 916.\n\n## Step 13: Calculate zh\nzh = pu - 74 = 916 - 74 = 842.\n\n## Step 14: Calculate bf\nbf = zh + 49 = 842 + 49 = 891.\n\n## Step 15: Calculate sc\nsc = bf + 55 = 891 + 55 = 946.\n\n## Step 16: Calculate tf\ntf = sc - 75 = 946 - 75 = 871.\n\n## Step 17: Calculate rw\nrw = tf + 74 = 871 + 74 = 945.\n\n## Step 18: Calculate pj\npj = rw + 54 = 945 + 54 = 999.\n\n## Step 19: Calculate tm\ntm = pj + 11 = 999 + 11 = 1010.\n\n## Step 20: Calculate wo\nwo = tm - 53 = 1010 - 53 = 957.\n\n## Step 21: Calculate ho\nho = wo + 44 = 957 + 44 = 1001.\n\n## Step 22: Calculate pw\npw = ho + 64 = 1001 + 64 = 1065.\n\n## Step 23: Calculate dn\ndn = pw - 58 = 1065 - 58 = 1007.\n\n## Step 24: Calculate tc\ntc = dn - 63 = 1007 - 63 = 944.\n\n## Step 25: Calculate jf\njf = tc + 94 = 944 + 94 = 1038.\n\n## Step 26: Calculate au\nau = jf - 24 = 1038 - 24 = 1014.\n\n## Step 27: Calculate kn\nkn = au + 94 = 1014 + 94 = 1108.\n\n## Step 28: Calculate um\num = kn + 35 = 1108 + 35 = 1143.\n\n## Step 29: Calculate qb\nqb = um + 48 = 1143 + 48 = 1191.\n\n## Step 30: Calculate sr\nsr = qb + 11 = 1191 + 11 = 1202.\n\n## Step 31: Calculate oy\noy = sr - 53 = 1202 - 53 = 1149.\n\n## Step 32: Calculate em\nem = oy + 82 = 1149 + 82 = 1231.\n\n## Step 33: Calculate ke\nke = em - 39 = 1231 - 39 = 1192.\n\n## Step 34: Calculate dv\ndv = ke + 62 = 1192 + 62 = 1254.\n\n## Step 35: Calculate cm\ncm = dv - 62 = 1254 - 62 = 1192.\n\n## Step 36: Calculate pf\npf = cm - 20 = 1192 - 20 = 1172.\n\n## Step 37: Calculate yl\nyl = pf + 46 = 1172 + 46 = 1218.\n\n## Step 38: Calculate ow\now = yl + 14 = 1218 + 14 = 1232.\n\n## Step 39: Calculate eg\neg = ow + 94 = 1232 + 94 = 1326.\n\n## Step 40: Calculate ch\nch = eg + 76 = 1326 + 76 = 1402.\n\n## Step 41: Calculate ni\nni = ch - 29 = 1402 - 29 = 1373.\n\n## Step 42: Calculate jg\njg = ni - 29 = 1373 - 29 = 1344.\n\n## Step 43: Calculate dk\ndk = jg + 34 = 1344 + 34 = 1378.\n\n## Step 44: Calculate tp\ntp = dk + 27 = 1378 + 27 = 1405.\n\n## Step 45: Calculate zp\nzp = tp - 59 = 1405 - 59 = 1346.\n\n## Step 46: Calculate uj\nuj = zp + 48 = 1346 + 48 = 1394.\n\n## Step 47: Calculate ie\nie = uj - 51 = 1394 - 51 = 1343.\n\n## Step 48: Calculate wx\nwx = ie - 10 = 1343 - 10 = 1333.\n\nThe final answer is: $\\boxed{1333}$"}
