3 = 715 - 13 = 702.\n\n## Step 45: Calculate tj\ntj = ox + 32 = 702 + 32 = 734.\n\n## Step 46: Calculate fm\nfm = tj - 31 = 734 - 31 = 703.\n\n## Step 47: Calculate ay\nay = fm + 87 = 703 + 87 = 790.\n\nThe final answer is: $\\boxed{790}$"}
