alculate sf\nsf = id + 78 = 564 + 78 = 642.\n\n## Step 9: Calculate tj\ntj = sf + 29 = 642 + 29 = 671.\n\n## Step 10: Calculate ky\nky = tj - 82 = 671 - 82 = 589.\n\n## Step 11: Calculate zt\nzt = ky - 86 = 589 - 86 = 503.\n\n## Step 12: Calculate gi\ngi = zt + 24 = 503 + 24 = 527.\n\n## Step 13: Calculate bj\nbj = gi + 66 = 527 + 66 = 593.\n\n## Step 14: Calculate un\nun = bj + 34 = 593 + 34 = 627.\n\n## Step 15: Calculate th\nth = un - 65 = 627 - 65 = 562.\n\n## Step 16: Calculate mx\nmx = th - 67 = 562 - 67 = 495.\n\n## Step 17: Calculate cz\ncz = mx + 97 = 495 + 97 = 592.\n\n## Step 18: Calculate jv\njv = cz - 28 = 592 - 28 = 564.\n\n## Step 19: Calculate of\nof = jv + 25 = 564 + 25 = 589.\n\n## Step 20: Calculate bt\nbt = of - 68 = 589 - 68 = 521.\n\n## Step 21: Calculate qo\nqo = bt - 31 = 521 - 31 = 490.\n\n## Step 22: Calculate fm\nfm = qo + 32 = 490 + 32 = 522.\n\n## Step 23: Calculate xt\nxt = fm - 54 = 522 - 54 = 468.\n\n## Step 24: Calculate nz\nnz = xt - 65 = 468 - 65 = 403.\n\n## Step 25: Calculate pa\npa = nz + 10 = 403 + 10 = 413.\n\n## Step 26: Calculate qp\nqp = pa + 52 = 413 + 52 = 465.\n\n## Step 27: Calculate le\nle = qp - 41 = 465 - 41 = 424.\n\n## Step 28: Calculate ki\nki = le + 43 = 424 + 43 = 467.\n\n## Step 29: Calculate rz\nrz = ki - 61 = 467 - 61 = 406.\n\n## Step 30: Calculate gw\ngw = rz + 59 = 406 + 59 = 465.\n\n## Step 31: Calculate ly\nly = gw - 96 = 465 - 96 = 369.\n\n## Step 32: Calculate oh\noh = ly + 77 = 369 + 77 = 446.\n\n## Step 33: Calculate fg\nfg = oh - 76 = 446 - 76 = 370.\n\n## Step 34: Calculate jl\njl = fg - 87 = 370 - 87 = 283.\n\n## Step 35: Calculate ri\nri = jl - 18 = 283 - 18 = 265.\n\n## Step 36: Calculate ye\nye = ri + 72 = 265 + 72 = 337.\n\n## Step 37: Calculate ou\nou = ye - 61 = 337 - 61 = 276.\n\n## Step 38: Calculate wy\nwy = ou + 63 = 276 + 63 = 339.\n\n## Step 39: Calculate ae\nae = wy - 78 = 339 - 78 = 261.\n\n## Step 40: Calculate jh\njh = ae - 72 = 261 - 72 = 189.\n\n## Step 41: Calculate fh\nfh = jh + 81 = 189 + 81 = 270.\n\n## Step 42: Calculate hr\nhr = fh - 22 = 270 - 22 = 248.\n\n## Step 43: Calculate vd\nvd = hr - 14 = 248 - 14 = 234.\n\n## Step 44: Calculate ok\nok = vd + 66 = 234 + 66 = 300.\n\n## Step 45: Calculate mj\nmj = ok + 16 = 300 + 16 = 316.\n\n## Step 46: Calculate vq\nvq = mj - 21 = 316 - 21 = 295.\n\n## Step 47: Calculate rt\nrt = vq + 23 = 295 + 23 = 318.\n\n## Step 48: Calculate re\nre = rt - 72 = 318 - 72 = 246.\n\nThe final answer is: $\\boxed{246}$"}
