ue of uv.\nuv = zx - 71 = 585 - 71 = 514.\n\n## Step 5: Calculate the value of nu.\nnu = uv - 79 = 514 - 79 = 435.\n\n## Step 6: Calculate the value of fq.\nfq = nu + 92 = 435 + 92 = 527.\n\n## Step 7: Calculate the value of pa.\npa = fq + 34 = 527 + 34 = 561.\n\n## Step 8: Calculate the value of al.\nal = pa - 55 = 561 - 55 = 506.\n\n## Step 9: Calculate the value of ot.\not = al - 98 = 506 - 98 = 408.\n\n## Step 10: Calculate the value of ta.\nta = ot - 96 = 408 - 96 = 312.\n\n## Step 11: Calculate the value of ku.\nku = ta - 24 = 312 - 24 = 288.\n\n## Step 12: Calculate the value of zi.\nzi = ku - 40 = 288 - 40 = 248.\n\n## Step 13: Calculate the value of sd.\nsd = zi - 56 = 248 - 56 = 192.\n\n## Step 14: Calculate the value of xr.\nxr = sd - 75 = 192 - 75 = 117.\n\n## Step 15: Calculate the value of iz.\niz = xr + 13 = 117 + 13 = 130.\n\n## Step 16: Calculate the value of vz.\nvz = iz - 65 = 130 - 65 = 65.\n\n## Step 17: Calculate the value of ab.\nab = vz + 76 = 65 + 76 = 141.\n\n## Step 18: Calculate the value of yp.\nyp = ab + 38 = 141 + 38 = 179.\n\n## Step 19: Calculate the value of fs.\nfs = yp - 15 = 179 - 15 = 164.\n\n## Step 20: Calculate the value of ri.\nri = fs - 36 = 164 - 36 = 128.\n\n## Step 21: Calculate the value of om.\nom = ri + 80 = 128 + 80 = 208.\n\n## Step 22: Calculate the value of gk.\ngk = om + 32 = 208 + 32 = 240.\n\n## Step 23: Calculate the value of nj.\nnj = gk + 99 = 240 + 99 = 339.\n\n## Step 24: Calculate the value of ih.\nih = nj - 14 = 339 - 14 = 325.\n\n## Step 25: Calculate the value of ci.\nci = ih - 45 = 325 - 45 = 280.\n\n## Step 26: Calculate the value of ws.\nws = ci - 54 = 280 - 54 = 226.\n\n## Step 27: Calculate the value of hw.\nhw = ws + 75 = 226 + 75 = 301.\n\n## Step 28: Calculate the value of cy.\ncy = hw - 57 = 301 - 57 = 244.\n\n## Step 29: Calculate the value of uf.\nuf = cy + 53 = 244 + 53 = 297.\n\n## Step 30: Calculate the value of nh.\nnh = uf - 68 = 297 - 68 = 229.\n\n## Step 31: Calculate the value of py.\npy = nh - 99 = 229 - 99 = 130.\n\n## Step 32: Calculate the value of dl.\ndl = py - 40 = 130 - 40 = 90.\n\n## Step 33: Calculate the value of at.\nat = dl + 69 = 90 + 69 = 159.\n\n## Step 34: Calculate the value of ck.\nck = at - 33 = 159 - 33 = 126.\n\n## Step 35: Calculate the value of ub.\nub = ck + 38 = 126 + 38 = 164.\n\n## Step 36: Calculate the value of iu.\niu = ub + 44 = 164 + 44 = 208.\n\n## Step 37: Calculate the value of dp.\ndp = iu - 32 = 208 - 32 = 176.\n\n## Step 38: Calculate the value of qr.\nqr = dp + 11 = 176 + 11 = 187.\n\n## Step 39: Calculate the value of rm.\nrm = qr + 41 = 187 + 41 = 228.\n\n## Step 40: Calculate the value of el.\nel = rm + 56 = 228 + 56 = 284.\n\n## Step 41: Calculate the value of fi.\nfi = el + 13 = 284 + 13 = 297.\n\n## Step 42: Calculate the value of vg.\nvg = fi - 95 = 297 - 95 = 202.\n\n## Step 43: Calculate the value of mi.\nmi = vg - 91 = 202 - 91 = 111.\n\n## Step 44: Calculate the value of ym.\nym = mi + 39 = 111 + 39 = 150.\n\n## Step 45: Calculate the value of gl.\ngl = ym - 72 = 150 - 72 = 78.\n\n## Step 46: Calculate the value of ca.\nca = gl - 43 = 78 - 43 = 35.\n\n## Step 47: Calculate the value of vw.\nvw = ca - 30 = 35 - 30 = 5.\n\n## Step 48: Calculate the value of gt.\ngt = vw - 47 = 5 - 47 = -42.\n\nThe final answer is: $\\boxed{-42}$"}
