alculate zx\nzx = qd - 72 = 284 - 72 = 212.\n\n## Step 10: Calculate kf\nkf = zx + 70 = 212 + 70 = 282.\n\n## Step 11: Calculate jj\njj = kf + 68 = 282 + 68 = 350.\n\n## Step 12: Calculate za\nza = jj + 73 = 350 + 73 = 423.\n\n## Step 13: Calculate it\nit = za + 28 = 423 + 28 = 451.\n\n## Step 14: Calculate ak\nak = it + 61 = 451 + 61 = 512.\n\n## Step 15: Calculate lr\nlr = ak - 14 = 512 - 14 = 498.\n\n## Step 16: Calculate lx\nlx = lr + 94 = 498 + 94 = 592.\n\n## Step 17: Calculate nf\nnf = lx - 87 = 592 - 87 = 505.\n\n## Step 18: Calculate fp\nfp = nf - 71 = 505 - 71 = 434.\n\n## Step 19: Calculate xs\nxs = fp + 39 = 434 + 39 = 473.\n\n## Step 20: Calculate mf\nmf = xs - 22 = 473 - 22 = 451.\n\n## Step 21: Calculate aw\naw = mf + 79 = 451 + 79 = 530.\n\n## Step 22: Calculate ir\nir = aw + 41 = 530 + 41 = 571.\n\n## Step 23: Calculate xt\nxt = ir + 60 = 571 + 60 = 631.\n\n## Step 24: Calculate jz\njz = xt + 24 = 631 + 24 = 655.\n\n## Step 25: Calculate au\nau = jz + 60 = 655 + 60 = 715.\n\n## Step 26: Calculate gb\ngb = au + 91 = 715 + 91 = 806.\n\n## Step 27: Calculate xw\nxw = gb - 40 = 806 - 40 = 766.\n\n## Step 28: Calculate yw\nyw = xw + 84 = 766 + 84 = 850.\n\n## Step 29: Calculate bc\nbc = yw + 40 = 850 + 40 = 890.\n\n## Step 30: Calculate sh\nsh = bc + 24 = 890 + 24 = 914.\n\n## Step 31: Calculate rz\nrz = sh + 92 = 914 + 92 = 1006.\n\n## Step 32: Calculate xp\nxp = rz + 44 = 1006 + 44 = 1050.\n\n## Step 33: Calculate yr\nyr = xp - 62 = 1050 - 62 = 988.\n\n## Step 34: Calculate iv\niv = yr + 61 = 988 + 61 = 1049.\n\n## Step 35: Calculate ke\nke = iv - 69 = 1049 - 69 = 980.\n\n## Step 36: Calculate qo\nqo = ke - 43 = 980 - 43 = 937.\n\n## Step 37: Calculate dk\ndk = qo + 17 = 937 + 17 = 954.\n\n## Step 38: Calculate ns\nns = dk + 35 = 954 + 35 = 989.\n\n## Step 39: Calculate tm\ntm = ns - 95 = 989 - 95 = 894.\n\n## Step 40: Calculate qr\nqr = tm - 74 = 894 - 74 = 820.\n\n## Step 41: Calculate uj\nuj = qr - 23 = 820 - 23 = 797.\n\n## Step 42: Calculate zi\nzi = uj + 24 = 797 + 24 = 821.\n\n## Step 43: Calculate gu\ngu = zi - 90 = 821 - 90 = 731.\n\n## Step 44: Calculate we\nwe = gu + 46 = 731 + 46 = 777.\n\n## Step 45: Calculate lo\nlo = we + 68 = 777 + 68 = 845.\n\n## Step 46: Calculate wu\nwu = lo - 28 = 845 - 28 = 817.\n\n## Step 47: Calculate bt\nbt = wu - 40 = 817 - 40 = 777.\n\nThe final answer is: $\\boxed{777}$"}
