: Calculate gw\ngw = lk - 17 = 220 - 17 = 203.\n\n## Step 6: Calculate vh\nvh = gw - 18 = 203 - 18 = 185.\n\n## Step 7: Calculate ky\nky = vh - 34 = 185 - 34 = 151.\n\n## Step 8: Calculate ei\nei = ky + 42 = 151 + 42 = 193.\n\n## Step 9: Calculate bb\nbb = ei - 54 = 193 - 54 = 139.\n\n## Step 10: Calculate ju\nju = bb - 31 = 139 - 31 = 108.\n\n## Step 11: Calculate pd\npd = ju - 22 = 108 - 22 = 86.\n\n## Step 12: Calculate qn\nqn = pd - 52 = 86 - 52 = 34.\n\n## Step 13: Calculate jy\njy = qn + 16 = 34 + 16 = 50.\n\n## Step 14: Calculate tt\ntt = jy - 12 = 50 - 12 = 38.\n\n## Step 15: Calculate mn\nmn = tt - 44 = 38 - 44 = -6.\n\n## Step 16: Calculate zf\nzf = mn - 91 = -6 - 91 = -97.\n\n## Step 17: Calculate pv\npv = zf + 35 = -97 + 35 = -62.\n\n## Step 18: Calculate fk\nfk = pv - 43 = -62 - 43 = -105.\n\n## Step 19: Calculate vs\nvs = fk + 72 = -105 + 72 = -33.\n\n## Step 20: Calculate cl\ncl = vs + 89 = -33 + 89 = 56.\n\n## Step 21: Calculate fn\nfn = cl + 61 = 56 + 61 = 117.\n\n## Step 22: Calculate ht\nht = fn - 85 = 117 - 85 = 32.\n\n## Step 23: Calculate fy\nfy = ht - 33 = 32 - 33 = -1.\n\n## Step 24: Calculate uz\nuz = fy + 42 = -1 + 42 = 41.\n\n## Step 25: Calculate wa\nwa = uz + 96 = 41 + 96 = 137.\n\n## Step 26: Calculate ih\nih = wa + 37 = 137 + 37 = 174.\n\n## Step 27: Calculate na\nna = ih + 78 = 174 + 78 = 252.\n\n## Step 28: Calculate vg\nvg = na - 50 = 252 - 50 = 202.\n\n## Step 29: Calculate ew\new = vg - 16 = 202 - 16 = 186.\n\n## Step 30: Calculate ze\nze = ew + 63 = 186 + 63 = 249.\n\n## Step 31: Calculate cs\ncs = ze + 98 = 249 + 98 = 347.\n\n## Step 32: Calculate me\nme = cs - 42 = 347 - 42 = 305.\n\n## Step 33: Calculate qd\nqd = me - 71 = 305 - 71 = 234.\n\n## Step 34: Calculate df\ndf = qd + 79 = 234 + 79 = 313.\n\n## Step 35: Calculate tz\ntz = df + 79 = 313 + 79 = 392.\n\n## Step 36: Calculate sr\nsr = tz + 38 = 392 + 38 = 430.\n\n## Step 37: Calculate xq\nxq = sr - 83 = 430 - 83 = 347.\n\n## Step 38: Calculate fp\nfp = xq + 47 = 347 + 47 = 394.\n\n## Step 39: Calculate qc\nqc = fp + 72 = 394 + 72 = 466.\n\n## Step 40: Calculate ty\nty = qc - 72 = 466 - 72 = 394.\n\n## Step 41: Calculate ng\nng = ty + 80 = 394 + 80 = 474.\n\n## Step 42: Calculate as\nas = ng - 76 = 474 - 76 = 398.\n\n## Step 43: Calculate rb\nrb = as - 19 = 398 - 19 = 379.\n\n## Step 44: Calculate or\nor = rb - 37 = 379 - 37 = 342.\n\n## Step 45: Calculate wn\nwn = or + 71 = 342 + 71 = 413.\n\n## Step 46: Calculate ca\nca = wn - 34 = 413 - 34 = 379.\n\n## Step 47: Calculate nz\nnz = ca - 86 = 379 - 86 = 293.\n\nThe final answer is: $\\boxed{293}$"}
