\n## Step 7: Calculate the value of nr\nnr = pm - 71\nnr = 686 - 71\nnr = 615\n\n## Step 8: Calculate the value of uv\nuv = nr + 76\nuv = 615 + 76\nuv = 691\n\n## Step 9: Calculate the value of lk\nlk = uv - 74\nlk = 691 - 74\nlk = 617\n\n## Step 10: Calculate the value of xa\nxa = lk - 57\nxa = 617 - 57\nxa = 560\n\n## Step 11: Calculate the value of fv\nfv = xa - 79\nfv = 560 - 79\nfv = 481\n\n## Step 12: Calculate the value of xl\nxl = fv + 10\nxl = 481 + 10\nxl = 491\n\n## Step 13: Calculate the value of kh\nkh = xl + 21\nkh = 491 + 21\nkh = 512\n\n## Step 14: Calculate the value of eg\neg = kh + 69\neg = 512 + 69\neg = 581\n\n## Step 15: Calculate the value of kg\nkg = eg - 67\nkg = 581 - 67\nkg = 514\n\n## Step 16: Calculate the value of qf\nqf = kg + 96\nqf = 514 + 96\nqf = 610\n\n## Step 17: Calculate the value of mx\nmx = qf - 26\nmx = 610 - 26\nmx = 584\n\n## Step 18: Calculate the value of ko\nko = mx - 46\nko = 584 - 46\nko = 538\n\n## Step 19: Calculate the value of mv\nmv = ko - 61\nmv = 538 - 61\nmv = 477\n\n## Step 20: Calculate the value of mg\nmg = mv - 31\nmg = 477 - 31\nmg = 446\n\n## Step 21: Calculate the value of ax\nax = mg - 66\nax = 446 - 66\nax = 380\n\n## Step 22: Calculate the value of wk\nwk = ax - 49\nwk = 380 - 49\nwk = 331\n\n## Step 23: Calculate the value of yi\nyi = wk + 19\nyi = 331 + 19\nyi = 350\n\n## Step 24: Calculate the value of hy\nhy = yi + 49\nhy = 350 + 49\nhy = 399\n\n## Step 25: Calculate the value of cu\ncu = hy - 22\ncu = 399 - 22\ncu = 377\n\n## Step 26: Calculate the value of hz\nhz = cu - 18\nhz = 377 - 18\nhz = 359\n\n## Step 27: Calculate the value of em\nem = hz - 74\nem = 359 - 74\nem = 285\n\n## Step 28: Calculate the value of vj\nvj = em - 94\nvj = 285 - 94\nvj = 191\n\n## Step 29: Calculate the value of ry\nry = vj + 32\nry = 191 + 32\nry = 223\n\n## Step 30: Calculate the value of ph\nph = ry - 93\nph = 223 - 93\nph = 130\n\n## Step 31: Calculate the value of cx\ncx = ph - 19\ncx = 130 - 19\ncx = 111\n\n## Step 32: Calculate the value of dw\ndw = cx + 26\ndw = 111 + 26\ndw = 137\n\n## Step 33: Calculate the value of qi\nqi = dw + 65\nqi = 137 + 65\nqi = 202\n\n## Step 34: Calculate the value of ar\nar = qi - 69\nar = 202 - 69\nar = 133\n\n## Step 35: Calculate the value of dx\ndx = ar + 35\ndx = 133 + 35\ndx = 168\n\n## Step 36: Calculate the value of wu\nwu = dx - 97\nwu = 168 - 97\nwu = 71\n\n## Step 37: Calculate the value of qr\nqr = wu + 64\nqr = 71 + 64\nqr = 135\n\n## Step 38: Calculate the value of pp\npp = qr + 11\npp = 135 + 11\npp = 146\n\n## Step 39: Calculate the value of ri\nri = pp - 89\nri = 146 - 89\nri = 57\n\n## Step 40: Calculate the value of zy\nzy = ri - 91\nzy = 57 - 91\nzy = -34\n\n## Step 41: Calculate the value of lu\nlu = zy + 82\nlu = -34 + 82\nlu = 48\n\n## Step 42: Calculate the value of wm\nwm = lu - 42\nwm = 48 - 42\nwm = 6\n\n## Step 43: Calculate the value of tu\ntu = wm + 43\ntu = 6 + 43\ntu = 49\n\n## Step 44: Calculate the value of gg\ngg = tu - 17\ngg = 49 - 17\ngg = 32\n\n## Step 45: Calculate the value of zc\nzc = gg + 45\nzc = 32 + 45\nzc = 77\n\n## Step 46: Calculate the value of qa\nqa = zc + 18\nqa = 77 + 18\nqa = 95\n\n## Step 47: Calculate the value of je\nje = qa + 47\nje = 95 + 47\nje = 142\n\n## Step 48: Calculate the value of vm\nvm = je - 74\nvm = 142 - 74\nvm = 68\n\nThe final answer is: $\\boxed{68}$"}
