lculate the value of yj\nyj = gi - 20 = 699 - 20 = 679.\n\n## Step 37: Calculate the value of sd\nsd = yj + 62 = 679 + 62 = 741.\n\n## Step 38: Calculate the value of cw\ncw = sd + 79 = 741 + 79 = 820.\n\n## Step 39: Calculate the value of cu\ncu = cw - 26 = 820 - 26 = 794.\n\n## Step 40: Calculate the value of px\npx = cu - 21 = 794 - 21 = 773.\n\n## Step 41: Calculate the value of we\nwe = px + 98 = 773 + 98 = 871.\n\n## Step 42: Calculate the value of ct\nct = we + 80 = 871 + 80 = 951.\n\n## Step 43: Calculate the value of uh\nuh = ct + 19 = 951 + 19 = 970.\n\n## Step 44: Calculate the value of fa\nfa = uh + 88 = 970 + 88 = 1058.\n\n## Step 45: Calculate the value of bp\nbp = fa + 51 = 1058 + 51 = 1109.\n\n## Step 46: Calculate the value of vj\nvj = bp + 74 = 1109 + 74 = 1183.\n\n## Step 47: Calculate the value of gu\ngu = vj + 43 = 1183 + 43 = 1226.\n\n## Step 48: Calculate the value of db\ndb = gu + 21 = 1226 + 21 = 1247.\n\nThe final answer is: $\\boxed{1247}$"}
