 = fo + 69 = 1168 + 69 = 1237\n\n## Step 42: Calculate pl\npl = dx - 23 = 1237 - 23 = 1214\n\n## Step 43: Calculate lx\nlx = pl + 86 = 1214 + 86 = 1300\n\n## Step 44: Calculate bm\nbm = lx - 45 = 1300 - 45 = 1255\n\n## Step 45: Calculate ux\nux = bm + 94 = 1255 + 94 = 1349\n\n## Step 46: Calculate di\ndi = ux - 30 = 1349 - 30 = 1319\n\n## Step 47: Calculate gs\ngs = di - 78 = 1319 - 78 = 1241\n\nThe final answer is: $\\boxed{1241}$"}
